# Local setup

Follow [docs/local-setup.md](docs/local-setup.md).

WordPress is Local WP. Astro is http://localhost:4321 and reads `WP_URL` from `astro/.env`. Do not commit that file, preview tokens, Turnstile secrets, or uploads. Symlink the theme and `spa-headless-core` into the Local site. Do not add hosting config.
